   "extremity": 1.32
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The council is officially launching a massive crackdown and will be slapping us all with heavy fines if our bins aren't off the sidewalk by 8am sharp. They’re finally pushing their overreaching agenda to control every single thing we do.",
   "author": 43,
   "step": 1,
